  "details": "Not 100% clear on reproduction steps. Has happened multiple times over two days starting with 2023.4.2p2 and also happened in 2023.4.2p2m.\n\n1. Connect via Virtual Desktop using 3 point\n\n2. Disconnect from Virtual Desktop\n\n3. Wait an unknown period; possibly the amount of time Virtual Desktop is configured before it treats the headset as disconnected (immediate or after a short delay)\n\n4. Reconnect to virtual desktop session.\n\nAt this point, movement animations are broken, emotes don't play or play a single frame, arms don't track controllers, etc.\n\nToggling Sit/Stand, reloading or changing avatars, and rejoining the world do not fix this. Only solution so far I've found is a full restart.",
